Error [E0985]: `val` is no longer a binding keyword in Jet
  --> tests/ui/if_expr_missing_else.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     val m = if 1 > 0 { 5 };
    |     ^^^
 Why: bindings are written with a sigil: `name :: value` (immutable) or `name := value` (mutable)
 Fix: write `name :: value` instead of `val name = value`

Error [E0003]: an `if` used as a value needs an `else` branch
  --> tests/ui/if_expr_missing_else.jet:2:27
    |
  2 |     val m = if 1 > 0 { 5 };
    |                           ^
 Why: in expression position both outcomes must produce a value (S68)
 Fix: add `else { … }` so every path has a value
